<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">${H}^{4}=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-1}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-2}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">\n{{field-4}}\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${H}^{2},$ we multiply $H$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}^{2} & =H\\cdot H \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${H}^{4}={H}^{2}\\cdot {H}^{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{H}^{4} & ={H}^{2}\\cdot {H}^{2} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -9 \\\\ 9 & -9\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719537 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c13dd03-e008-5c45-b787-b16e24662667" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719536}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1c13dd03-e008-5c45-b787-b16e24662667" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719536} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b7e9f88-4a8a-5c1d-87dd-90daba670af8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719540} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d40b5107-faff-5685-909e-0dcba3c75ce5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719552}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d40b5107-faff-5685-909e-0dcba3c75ce5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719552} :answer-field/id #uuid "532633d5-6f95-5392-b41e-af797084b63a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719542} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f9a9ada-8a9e-5974-a048-d2999fcfb898" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719534}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f9a9ada-8a9e-5974-a048-d2999fcfb898" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719534} :answer-field/id #uuid "8496c3e8-bd16-5e2c-80b7-b5bd9a7ff2a9" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719548} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07b840c4-6460-593f-b328-0da96ea3f337" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719533}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "07b840c4-6460-593f-b328-0da96ea3f337" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719533} :answer-field/id #uuid "ee630176-65c3-5773-a0ee-c3d0cc0497b1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719554}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "23547deb-1f89-57c1-90a2-6a95ad523878" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$. Find $B^4$.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$B^4=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First compute $B^2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B^2 &= B\\cdot B \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1-1 & 1+2 \\\\ -1-2 & -1+4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $B^4=B^2\\cdot B^2$, square the result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B^4 &= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}0\\cdot0+3\\cdot(-3) & 0\\cdot3+3\\cdot3 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot0+3\\cdot(-3) & (-3)\\cdot3+3\\cdot3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}-9 & 9 \\\\ -9 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719544 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0401877c-e91c-59f1-b9c4-ddb54e5a0d75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719532} {:answer/id #uuid "4c6e3d91-ade3-549a-a349-acb7b930e89c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719541} {:answer/id #uuid "98f76efe-4faf-59ac-abd8-f0d3f00256fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719550} {:answer/id #uuid "f6c3dc16-64e9-56e2-a931-81869da631a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719555} {:answer/id #uuid "f6eac5b7-1a3d-5a07-8c7b-641b957158f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719556}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "98f76efe-4faf-59ac-abd8-f0d3f00256fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719550} :answer-field/id #uuid "13c3e1a0-254e-585b-99c2-812a22089d76" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719535}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "738e91ea-6e61-52c2-8e72-aeef05aefec5" :question/problem "If $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$, then $A^2=$" :question/worked-solution "To find $A^2$, multiply $A$ by itself using row-by-column products:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A^2 &= A\\cdot A \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1\\cdot1+2\\cdot(-1) & 1\\cdot2+2\\cdot0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot1+0\\cdot(-1) & (-1)\\cdot2+0\\cdot0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe exponent counts matrix factors; it does not square each entry."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719547 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f8c74226-9ee1-5d5f-8591-90a7211c46aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f8c74226-9ee1-5d5f-8591-90a7211c46aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719557} :answer-field/id #uuid "40fecbe7-cb66-5bfc-832e-e04af7b67a38" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719539} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc4747ca-0284-5195-ac57-aee0dff3f892" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719558}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc4747ca-0284-5195-ac57-aee0dff3f892" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719558} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b744691-c710-5513-845d-89977ef2df24" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719545} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a06db10-b271-5ad8-9aef-63b65c70a214" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719543}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5a06db10-b271-5ad8-9aef-63b65c70a214" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719543} :answer-field/id #uuid "7cffb58c-79f3-5710-a24e-4cc45b77f6fb" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719546} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "95234e3c-4776-5eac-bbf0-7319eae66552" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719549}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "95234e3c-4776-5eac-bbf0-7319eae66552" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719549} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae5e26b7-e0ff-5729-b190-503faca08932" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719551} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27eaf271-2ab3-58bc-8686-ed8dff80e290" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719538}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "27eaf271-2ab3-58bc-8686-ed8dff80e290" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719538} :answer-field/id #uuid "d92839e4-dd23-53cf-8263-152fea97df84" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719553}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "812ad39a-35a8-5d8f-9bb3-4d47c582659b" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$. Find the missing entries of $C^3$.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$C^3=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>$-1$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td><td>$1$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$2$</td><td>$1$</td><td>{{field-5}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "First compute $C^2$ by multiplying rows of $C$ by columns of $C$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C^2 &= C\\cdot C \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}1-1+0 & -1+0+0 & 0-1+0 \\\\ 1+0+0 & -1+0+1 & 0+0+1 \\\\ 0+1+0 & 0+0+1 & 0+1+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &= \\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow use $C^3=C^2\\cdot C$:\n\n$$\nC^3=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe five missing entries are obtained from these row-by-column products:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(C^3)_{11} &= 0\\cdot1+(-1)\\cdot1+(-1)\\cdot0=-1 \\\\ (C^3)_{13} &= 0\\cdot0+(-1)\\cdot1+(-1)\\cdot1=-2 \\\\ (C^3)_{21} &= 1\\cdot1+0\\cdot1+1\\cdot0=1 \\\\ (C^3)_{22} &= 1\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot0+1\\cdot1=0 \\\\ (C^3)_{33} &= 1\\cdot0+1\\cdot1+2\\cdot1=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719720 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e457e7b-ecc2-5fe6-804c-05ab81de7287" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719742}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e457e7b-ecc2-5fe6-804c-05ab81de7287" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719742} :answer-field/id #uuid "0c3fd65f-9538-5c5f-bee5-786d2897d14a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719716} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4f49495-9f41-50ba-9640-d522e103a4af" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719756}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4f49495-9f41-50ba-9640-d