trix}\n$$\n\nCompute the entries by row-by-column products:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A^2)_{11} &= 1\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 0=2 \\\\ (A^2)_{12} &= 1\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 1=-2 \\\\ (A^2)_{13} &= 1\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 1=-1 \\\\ (A^2)_{21} &= (-1)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 0=-1 \\\\ (A^2)_{22} &= (-1)\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 1=0 \\\\ (A^2)_{23} &= (-1)\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 1=0 \\\\ (A^2)_{31} &= 0\\cdot 1+1\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 0=-1 \\\\ (A^2)_{32} &= 0\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 1=1 \\\\ (A^2)_{33} &= 0\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 1=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\nA^2=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNow use $A^3=A^2\\cdot A$:\n\n$$\nA^3=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nCompute the entries by row-by-column products:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(A^3)_{11} &= 2\\cdot 1+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 0=4 \\\\ (A^3)_{12} &= 2\\cdot (-1)+(-2)\\cdot 0+(-1)\\cdot 1=-3 \\\\ (A^3)_{13} &= 2\\cdot (-1)+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 1=-1 \\\\ (A^3)_{21} &= (-1)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 0=-1 \\\\ (A^3)_{22} &= (-1)\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 1=1 \\\\ (A^3)_{23} &= (-1)\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 1=1 \\\\ (A^3)_{31} &= (-1)\\cdot 1+1\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 0=-2 \\\\ (A^3)_{32} &= (-1)\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 0+0\\cdot 1=1 \\\\ (A^3)_{33} &= (-1)\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 1=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\nA^3=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186719778 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01bb07d4-bb70-5b39-8c38-c2e7e575c4ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186719760}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "01bb07d4-bb70-5b39-8c38-c2e7e575c4ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type